"""Build the bilingual guides for the dataset showcase."""
from pathlib import Path
import html
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
pages={
'project-guide':('项目说明','Project guide',[
 ('定位','Purpose','PACTHub 以数据集、benchmark 和 pipeline 为核心。代表样本涵盖旋转小鼠、扫描小鼠、叶片、人手、小鼠脑、背侧全躯干小鼠、单次曝光肝脏、方形靶仿体与两组连续成像。','PACTHub centres on a dataset, a benchmark and a reconstruction pipeline. The showcase covers rotation and scanned mouse acquisitions, leaf, hand, mouse brain, a dorsal whole-trunk mouse volume, single-exposure liver and square-target phantom specimens, and two independent image sequences.'),
 ('使用入口','Explore the data','样本详情可切换深度、灰度及三维视图，并放大查看。连续成像支持逐帧浏览、自定义框选、移动和缩放区域，实时计算强度曲线。','Sample details offer depth, intensity and 3D views with image enlargement. Temporal imaging supports frame-by-frame navigation and live intensity traces from regions that users draw, move and resize.'),
 ('资源状态','Resource status','代表性样本已存档于 <a class="text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23496053">Zenodo</a>，采用 CC BY 4.0。网站 05 提供 Zenodo、Google Drive、代码和引用入口。','Representative samples are archived on <a class="text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23496053">Zenodo</a> under CC BY 4.0. Section 05 provides Zenodo, Google Drive, code and citation links.')]),
'data-guide':('数据与显示说明','Data and display guide',[
 ('代表样本','Representative specimens','旋转小鼠来自作者保存的三维处理体。扫描小鼠使用 70 个位置的 BP 重建，将 1.44–5.76 MHz 与 0.5–8 MHz 两个三维体等权相加。小鼠脑、背侧全躯干小鼠与肝脏直接使用 3D-PanoPACT 官方 v3 发布的 Fig. 3、Fig. 5d 和 Fig. 2a 数值三维体。肝脏为单次曝光重建。叶片、人手与方形靶仿体使用 20 次曝光的 BP 重建。三种视图均由对应 MAT/H5 数组生成，共用 XYZ 裁剪范围和线性窗。','The rotation mouse uses an author-saved processed volume. The scanned mouse combines 70 positions and sums BP volumes reconstructed with 1.44–5.76 MHz and 0.5–8 MHz passbands. Brain, dorsal whole-trunk mouse and liver views use the official 3D-PanoPACT v3 numerical volumes from Fig. 3, Fig. 5d and Fig. 2a. Liver is a single-exposure reconstruction. Leaf, hand and square-target phantom use 20-exposure BP reconstructions. All views are generated from the corresponding MAT/H5 arrays with one common XYZ crop and linear window.'),
 ('官方来源','Official sources','Xuanhao Wang、Yuqian Meng、Xiali Gao：<a class="text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.28443374.v3">3D-PanoPACT_Data_Code v3</a>，<a class="text-link" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>。相关论文：<a class="text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-65054-x">Nature Communications 16, 10077 (2025)</a>。网站对官方三维体进行轴重排、统一裁剪、线性显示及重新渲染。','Xuanhao Wang, Yuqian Meng and Xiali Gao: <a class="text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.28443374.v3">3D-PanoPACT_Data_Code v3</a>, <a class="text-link" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>. Article: <a class="text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-65054-x">Nature Communications 16, 10077 (2025)</a>. Website adaptations comprise axis reordering, common cropping, linear display and re-rendering.'),
 ('颜色、强度与坐标','Colour, intensity and coordinates','所有深度 MIP 使用 3D-PanoPACT Trunk 配色，色条表示当前 Z 层范围内的相对位置 0–1。每个样本使用独立线性强度窗，γ=1；网站不再施加额外背景遮罩或亮度变换。灰度 MIP 展示强度，三维视图为斜向最大强度体投影。','All depth MIPs use the 3D-PanoPACT Trunk palette. The colour bar denotes relative position, 0–1, within each displayed Z slab. Each specimen has an independent linear intensity window, with gamma 1; the website adds no background mask or brightness transform. Grayscale MIPs represent intensity; 3D views use oblique maximum-intensity ray casting.'),
 ('时序读数', 'Temporal readouts', '用户在 MIP 上绘制、移动或缩放区域，曲线实时更新。各时刻先经 Z 轴旋转和 XY 平移配准至首帧，网页使用整段时序共用标定的 8 位线性 MIP 预览，均值取自所有时刻共同有效的像素。每条曲线使用同一组选定像素，相对强度为 I(t)/I(0)。显示窗和比例尺不参与计算。', 'Draw, move or resize a region on the MIP to update its trace in real time. Frames are aligned to the first frame by Z rotation and XY translation. The web preview uses registered MIPs with one shared 8-bit linear calibration per series and pixels valid at every timepoint, with the same selected pixels throughout each trace. Relative intensity is I(t)/I(0). Display windowing and scale-bar annotations do not enter the calculation.'),
 ('比例尺与编号','Scales and specimen IDs','八个样本的比例尺固定在展示框右下角，按实际图像缩放；01 概览只展示图像。记录了原生坐标的数据按坐标计算。官方鼠脑的显示网格约为 0.04 mm，由与本地 BP 结构配准转移；官方全躯干约为 0.0833 mm，由原稿 Fig. 5d 的 5 mm 比例尺转移。肝脏显示网格约为 0.0564 mm，由 Fig. 2a 的 5 mm 比例尺和三维包围框投影标定。三者按各向同性显示网格渲染，详细校准依据见元数据。官方发布体使用 3DPanoPACT-Fig3、3DPanoPACT-Fig5d 和 3DPanoPACT-Fig2a 唯一编号，其余样本沿用已知采集时间编号。','Sample scales remain anchored at the lower right of the preview frame and track actual image scaling; Section 01 shows images only. Recorded native coordinates determine scales where available. The official brain display grid is approximately 0.04 mm, transferred through registration to the local BP grid. The official trunk grid is approximately 0.0833 mm, transferred from the manuscript Fig. 5d 5-mm bar. The liver display grid is approximately 0.0564 mm, calibrated through the Fig. 2a 5-mm bar and volume-box projection. These use an isotropic display-grid assumption; metadata records calibration details. Official volumes use unique IDs 3DPanoPACT-Fig3, 3DPanoPACT-Fig5d and 3DPanoPACT-Fig2a; other specimens retain known acquisition timestamps.'),
 ('采样与播放','Sampling and playback','全身序列展示 16 个采样时刻，覆盖 9.8 min；腹部 800 nm 序列展示前 20 个时刻，覆盖 19.23 min。播放按采样帧加速，曲线点保留实际时间间隔。曲线连接相邻测量值，不进行模型拟合。','The whole-body series displays 16 sampled timepoints over 9.8 min. The abdominal 800 nm series displays its first 20 timepoints over 19.23 min. Playback is accelerated by sampled frame; plotted points retain their actual time spacing. Lines connect adjacent measurements without model fitting.')]),
'algorithm-guide':('重建与评测流程','Reconstruction and evaluation',[
 ('动态演示', 'Animated walkthroughs', '04 区域提供两个视频缩略图：32 秒的 FOV／声速选择，以及 51 秒的 Q 计算。点击后打开完整视频，可跳转章节、拖动进度或全屏观看；字幕位于图像下方。04 标题区的 GitHub 入口提供流程代码下载，05 的 GitHub 仓库入口提供源码、参数示例和文档。', 'Section 04 presents two video previews: a 32-second FOV / sound-speed walkthrough and the 51-second Q calculation. Click to open the complete film, jump between chapters, scrub or enter fullscreen. Captions sit below the image. The GitHub link in the Section 04 heading opens the pipeline download. The repository entry in Section 05 provides source, parameter examples and documentation.'),
 ('从 PAdata 到三维体', 'From PAdata to 3D volumes', '标准流程为 PAdata → 参数核对与预处理 → FOV 选择 → 声速选择 → BP／MB 重建 → 数值三维体与 MIP。每个采集沿用已发布的 sample_metadata.json 和 reconstruction_parameters.json。', 'The standard workflow is PAdata → validation and preprocessing → FOV selection → sound-speed selection → BP / MB → numerical 3D volumes and MIPs. Each acquisition uses its published sample_metadata.json and reconstruction_parameters.json.'),
 ('获取代码', 'Get the code', '<a class="text-link" href="../assets/downloads/pacthub-workflow-v1.4.0.zip" download>下载流程与接口代码 ↓</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ZhiboXiao/PACTHub/tree/main/reconstruction" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub 源码与完整使用说明 ↗</a>。压缩包包含 PAdata／JSON 接口、预处理、MB、流程伪代码和测试；默认接入基于公开文献的基础 UBP；实际使用的内部 BP 程序属于保密内容，不对外分发；解压后的 README_CN.md 给出安装命令、运行步骤和字段对应表。', '<a class="text-link" href="../assets/downloads/pacthub-workflow-v1.4.0.zip" download>Download the workflow and interfaces ↓</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ZhiboXiao/PACTHub/tree/main/reconstruction" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source and complete guide on GitHub ↗</a>. The archive contains PAdata/JSON interfaces, preprocessing, MB, workflow pseudocode and tests. The package includes a public literature UBP. The actual internal BP program is confidential and is not distributed. Its README provides installation commands, execution steps and the input contract.'),
 ('两份参数文件', 'Two parameter files', 'sample_metadata.json 核对采集编号、FTC 存储轴、形状和帧数；reconstruction_parameters.json 提供信号、几何、FOV、声速及重建设置。探测器坐标可从 Calibration 文件内嵌到同一 JSON；MB 参数保存在 defaults.mb。', 'sample_metadata.json checks the acquisition ID, FTC storage axes, shape and frame count. reconstruction_parameters.json supplies signal, geometry, FOV, sound-speed and reconstruction settings. Detector coordinates can be embedded from the Calibration file into that JSON; MB settings are stored in defaults.mb.'),
 ('FOV 与声速', 'FOV and sound speed', '可直接沿用记录的视野和声速，也可开启自动选择。FOV 在大视场 BP 上估计 XY 中心与长轴；声速选择对固定帧、几何和预处理扫描候选声速。输出保存候选得分及本次生效的参数副本。', 'Retain the recorded FOV and sound speed or enable selection. Large-FOV BP estimates the XY centre and long axis. Sound-speed selection scans candidates with fixed frames, geometry and preprocessing. Outputs include candidate scores and an effective parameter pair for replay.'),
 ('BP 与 MB 输出', 'BP and MB outputs', '默认使用公开文献 UBP，预处理保留原带通、能量归一化和截取顺序；MB 使用有限圆盘前向／伴随模型。MB 同时生成使用相同预处理 RF 的 BP_matched。三维体按 ZYX 保存，坐标单位为 mm；显示窗独立于定量数据。', 'Public literature UBP is connected by default, with the recorded bandpass, energy normalization and crop order. MB uses a finite-disk forward/adjoint model. MB also exports BP_matched with identical preprocessed RF. Volumes use ZYX order and millimetre coordinates; display windowing is separate from numerical data.'),
 ('运行与网页展示', 'Computation and website display', '下载采集数据与代码后，在本机或 GPU 服务器运行。网页提供样本展示、操作说明和下载入口。重建得到的数值体可进一步生成统一显示窗、物理范围和比例尺的展示资源。', 'Download the acquisition data and code, then run reconstruction on a local machine or GPU server. The website provides sample displays, instructions and downloads. Numerical outputs can then be prepared as display assets with defined windows, physical bounds and scale bars.'),
 ('小鼠 Q 实例', 'Measured-mouse Q', '第 06 章使用论文中的小鼠 GT 与待评估图像。三维计算依次展示局部背景、正对比度、参考定义的弱／强区域和结构重叠，Q = 82.53。', 'Chapter 06 uses the manuscript mouse GT and test image. The 3D calculation extracts local background, positive contrast, reference-defined weak/strong support and structural overlap, giving Q = 82.53.'),
 ('评测','Evaluation','PSNR、全图 SSIM 和 L1 描述整体误差与相似度。结构质量 Q 提供补充，关注高能量血管区域及弱结构。比较时统一空间对齐、评测范围、参考体及强度约定。','PSNR, full-image SSIM and L1 measure overall error and similarity. Structural quality Q complements them by examining high-energy vascular regions and weak structures. Comparisons share spatial alignment, evaluation domain, reference volume and intensity conventions.'),
 ('Q 计算视频', 'Q calculation video', '51 秒视频依次展示配对输入、正局部对比度、参考管状支撑、弱强分组、结构重叠与实测小鼠。Q = 100√(Dweak Dstrong)，每组 D = 2Σmin(g·hX,hR)/Σ(g·hX+hR)。全部计算在三维体上进行，投影用于展示。', 'The 51-second video follows paired input, positive local contrast, reference tubular support, weak/strong groups, structural overlap and a measured mouse. Q = 100√(Dweak Dstrong), with D = 2Σmin(g·hX,hR)/Σ(g·hX+hR) in each group. Calculations use 3D volumes; projections illustrate the steps.'),
 ('展示与定量','Display and quantification','展示图可使用独立线性窗；定量指标在预先定义的数值数据上计算。连续成像对每个用户选框使用跨时刻相同的有效像素，保留所有测量时刻。各时刻共享显示窗。','Display images may use independent linear windows; metrics are calculated on the predefined numerical data. Each user-selected temporal region uses the same valid pixels across all measured timepoints. One display window is shared throughout the sequence.')]),
'content-map':('内容与来源','Content and provenance',[
 ('样本集合','Specimen collection','data/samples.json 记录八个代表样本及其视图。data/display-provenance.json 记录源文件名、SHA-256 与图像转换过程。','data/samples.json records eight representative specimens and their views. data/display-provenance.json records source filenames, SHA-256 hashes and image conversions.'),
 ('连续成像','Temporal imaging','data/temporal.json 记录测量时刻、显示窗、区域坐标及原始与相对读数。data/temporal-readouts.csv 提供相同读数的表格形式。','data/temporal.json records measured times, display windows, region coordinates and linear and relative readouts. data/temporal-readouts.csv provides the same measurements as a table.'),
 ('生成与验证','Preparation and validation','scripts/prepare_showcase.py 读取已审核的配图数据；register_temporal.py 完成配准与读数；build_sample_views.py 生成带比例尺的多视图；build_q_video.py 绘制 Q 视频。scripts/validate_site.py 检查数据一致性、资源链接、元数据及转换记录。','scripts/prepare_showcase.py reads the audited figure sources; register_temporal.py registers frames and recomputes readouts; build_sample_views.py prepares scaled views; build_q_video.py renders the Q video. scripts/validate_site.py checks data consistency, resource links, metadata and conversion records.')]),
'release-checklist':('资源发布说明','Release information',[
 ('数据引用','Dataset citation','使用本数据集，请引用数据记录与数据集论文。数据记录：Xiao, Z. (2026). PACTHub [Data set]. Zenodo. <a class="text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23496053">10.5281/zenodo.23496053</a>。数据集论文的 arXiv 链接与引用将在发布后补充。','If you use the dataset, please cite the data record and dataset paper. Data record: Xiao, Z. (2026). PACTHub [Data set]. Zenodo. <a class="text-link" href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23496053">10.5281/zenodo.23496053</a>. The arXiv link and paper citation will be added when published.'),
 ('当前可用', 'Available now', '八个样本的多视图展示；两组共 36 个测量时刻的图像、自定义区域与实时强度曲线；重建和评测流程说明。', 'Multi-view displays for eight specimens; 36 measured timepoints across two sequences with interactive region selection and live intensity traces; reconstruction and evaluation documentation.'),
 ('完整数据发布','Full dataset release','完整 RF 数据包需附采集参数、探测器坐标、重建配置、文件校验和、数据许可与正式引用。网站资源入口由 data/site-config.json 的实际链接管理。','Full RF data packages include acquisition parameters, detector coordinates, reconstruction settings, checksums, data licence and formal citation. Resource availability is controlled by the actual links in data/site-config.json.'),
 ('维护检查','Maintenance checks','更新数据时同步图像、数值、坐标与来源记录，检查中英文界面、移动端、逐帧联动和所有下载路径。','When updating data, synchronize images, measurements, coordinates and provenance. Check both languages, mobile layout, frame synchronization and every download path.')])}
for slug,(zh,en,sections) in pages.items():
 nav=' '.join(f'<a href="{k}.html">{v[1]}</a>' for k,v in pages.items())
 body=''
 for lang in ['zh','en']:
  body+=f'<section data-lang-section="{lang}" lang="{lang}"'+(' hidden' if lang=='zh' else '')+'>'
  body+=f'<h1>{zh if lang=="zh" else en}</h1>'
  for a,b,c,d in sections: body+=f'<h2>{a if lang=="zh" else b}</h2><p>{c if lang=="zh" else d}</p>'
  body+='</section>'
 text=f'''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>{en} · PACTHub</title><link rel="icon" href="../assets/images/favicon.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/styles.css"><style>[hidden]{{display:none!important}}.doc-content{{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px}}.doc-topbar,.doc-nav{{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:24px}}.doc-nav{{font-size:12px}}.doc-content h1{{margin-top:44px}}.doc-content h2{{font-size:24px;margin-top:36px}}.doc-content p{{line-height:1.85;color:#d0d6e0}}.doc-links{{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:40px}}.doc-content .language-switch{{margin-left:auto}}</style><script src="../assets/js/i18n.js" defer></script><script src="../assets/js/docs-i18n.js" defer></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/linear-theme.css?v=20261027-silver"></head><body class="doc-page"><main class="doc-content"><header class="doc-topbar"><a href="../index.html">← PACTHub</a><div class="language-switch"><button type="button" data-language="zh" aria-label="切换为中文">中</button><button type="button" data-language="en" aria-label="Switch to English">EN</button></div></header><nav class="doc-nav">{nav}</nav>{body}</main></body></html>'''
 (R/'docs'/f'{slug}.html').write_text(text,encoding='utf-8')
(R/'assets/js/docs-i18n.js').write_text("""'use strict';
(() => {
  function render() {
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-lang-section]').forEach(el => el.hidden = el.dataset.langSection !== window.PACTI18N.language);
  }
  document.addEventListener('pact:languagechange', render); render();
})();
""",encoding='utf-8')
